# Borghertz's Harmonious Hands (jeuno 53): the template for xi.job.BRD (10), after a completed Borghertz quest: every
# handler of the quest once (the Warring Hands' flows take the template's edges). A level 75 BRD, 1000 gil, its
# prerequisite (Jeuno.TheRequiem) completed, Borghertz's Wild Hands completed (a GM; entry 8 of the loop), a
# ZvahlCofferKey. Guslam: 155 (Option 10); begun; 43 (no Old Gauntlets). CastleZvahlBaileys's Treasure Coffer: the Old Gauntlets.
# Guslam 26; finished at Prog 0, a Borghertz quest completed: Prog 3 (the intermediaries skipped). Deadly Minnow at
# Prog 3: nil (his shop). Prog 1 (a GM): Deadly Minnow 24; finished: Prog 2. Yin Pocanakhu 220; its update: the gil
# taken, Prog 3. qm1 20; finished 1: Prog 4. The Torch: Dark Spark popped; its death: Prog 5; the Torch: the Shadow
# Flames. qm1 48; finished: completed (ChoralCuffs), fame +7 x3, both key items taken.
lists UpperJeuno/Guslam/onTrigger UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/155 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/26 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/24 UpperJeuno/Deadly_Minnow/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Yin_Pocanakhu/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventUpdate/220 PortJeuno/qm1/onTrigger PortJeuno/onEventFinish/20 PortJeuno/onEventFinish/48 CastleZvahlBaileys/Torch/onTrigger CastleZvahlBaileys/Dark_Spark/onMobDeath CastleZvahlBaileys/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-4.2,1.3,47.5 job=BRD lvl=75 gil=1000
quest Jeuno.TheRequiem completed
quest Jeuno.BorghertzsWildHands completed
item ZvahlCofferKey
login
trigger Guslam                          # available: 155 (Option 10)
finish                                  # begun
trigger Guslam                          # accepted, no Old Gauntlets: 43
finish
warp 110.041,-20.002,106.811 CastleZvahlBaileys
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer ZvahlCofferKey x1      # the old-gauntlet zone: the Old Gauntlets
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
warp -4.2,1.3,47.5 UpperJeuno
trigger Guslam                          # the Old Gauntlets: 26
finish                                  # Prog 0, not the first: Prog 3
trigger Deadly_Minnow                   # Prog 3: nil; his own script (his shop)
charvar Quest[3][53]Prog 1              # a GM
trigger Deadly_Minnow                   # Prog 1: 24
finish                                  # Prog 2
warp 35.3,4.1,-44 LowerJeuno
trigger Yin_Pocanakhu                   # Prog 2: 220
update 220 option=0                     # 1000 gil: taken; Prog 3; updateEvent(1, 1, 0, 0)
finish
warp -52.7,6.1,-4.6 PortJeuno
trigger qm1                             # Prog 3: 20
finish option=1                         # Prog 4
warp 61.4,-26.2,15 CastleZvahlBaileys
trigger Torch                           # Prog 4: Dark Spark popped; SENSE_OF_FOREBODING
kill DARK_SPARK                         # its death: Prog 5
trigger Torch                           # Prog 5, no flames: the Shadow Flames; noAction
warp -52.7,6.1,-4.6 PortJeuno
trigger qm1                             # Prog 5, the flames: 48
finish                                  # completed: ChoralCuffs; fame +7 x3; both key items taken
